export anchor BoldModernStyle:
    number: 191
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Bold modern
    idea: A confident, editorial dashboard of black heavy headings and oversized numbers on white, where generous whitespace replaces boxes and a single dark lime accent marks progress, the current page and the primary action.
    base: light
    palette:
        white: #ffffff, the page and fields
        chalk: #f4f4f0, the style sheet band
        black: #0d0d0d, headings, figures, body, the 4px section rules and the secondary button outline
        graphite: #5a5a55, meta, labels, axis text and last week's outlined bars
        hairline: #deded8, 1px row dividers and the empty progress line, never text
        lime: #456300, the one accent, the primary button, current nav bar, progress fills, this week's bars, the brand full stop and focus
        limeWash: #f1f6df, the focused search and field fill
        signal: #b42318, Behind, the overdue figure and its rule, with a solid square and cross
        rust: #8a4b00, At risk with a solid triangle and bar
    type:
        One grotesque stack, Helvetica Neue, Inter, Arial Nova, Arial,
        Liberation Sans, sans-serif, in weights 400, 700 and 800 with tight
        negative tracking on large sizes. The greeting is 96px extra bold
        at minus 0.045em, KPI figures 104px extra bold, section titles
        40px extra bold, project names 24px bold, row percents 56px extra
        bold, body 16px at 1.5, and labels 13px bold caps tracked 0.08em.
    layout:
        No sidebar and no cards. A slim white header holds the bold
        wordmark with a lime full stop, six plain bold word links with Home
        in black over a 4px lime bar, an underlined search field, a lime
        pill New project button, a round outlined bell and a black initials
        disc with Mara Okafor. The hero is a small caps date, a huge Hi,
        Mara. headline and a 28px overdue line with a red square and a See
        them link. Four giant figures follow in a row, each under a 4px
        black rule with a caps label below, the overdue figure red under a
        red rule with a square symbol. Projects run full width under a 4px
        rule with the title at left and totals at right, as numbered rows
        01 to 06 with a big name, a meta line of team, tasks, due date and
        days left, the status word, a giant percent at the far right and a
        4px progress line beneath. The last band splits 7 to 5, a Tasks
        completed block with a giant 73, the change against 59, and 14 bars
        dated 18 to 31, last week outlined graphite and this week solid
        lime, beside an Activity list with caps times in a left column.
        Below 1100px the last band stacks. On phones the nav wraps under
        the wordmark, figures form a 2 by 2 grid at 64px, project rows put
        status and percent on a second line, and the chart scrolls sideways
        inside its block.
    spacing: An 8px unit with big jumps of 24, 48, 80 and 120px. 80px above each section, 24px between project rows.
    density: Low. Few, very large elements, with whitespace doing the grouping.
    corners: Square for rules, bars and fields. Buttons, the bell and avatars are pills or circles.
    borders: 4px black rules above sections and figures, 1px hairlines between activity rows. No boxes.
    shadows: None.
    icons: Almost none. Solid status shapes at 16px and 2px line icons for search, bell and plus.
    focus: A 3px lime outline offset 3px. Fields get a 3px lime underline and a lime wash.
    tone: Short and direct with full stops, such as Hi, Mara. and 4 tasks are overdue.
